# Atlas Core Component Tokens Specification
**Author:** Onyx Marlow  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D15 07:50  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Comprehensive component design token dictionary for project Atlas Core, structured according to the data governance standards and functional requirements outlined in Business Document: Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "metadata": {
    "project": "Atlas Core",
    "author": "Onyx Marlow",
    "sourceResource": "Business Document: Company Document",
    "provenance": "Token taxonomy, scale constraints, and semantic hierarchies derived directly from brand and accessibility guidelines established in Business Document: Company Document."
  },
  "color": {
    "brand": {
      "primary": { "value": "#0A58CA", "type": "color", "description": "Base primary tone defined in Business Document: Company Document" },
      "secondary": { "value": "#6C757D", "type": "color" }
    },
    "interactive": {
      "default": { "value": "{color.brand.primary}", "type": "color" },
      "hover": { "value": "#084298", "type": "color" },
      "active": { "value": "#052C65", "type": "color" },
      "disabled": { "value": "#E9ECEF", "type": "color" }
    }
  },
  "spacing": {
    "base": { "value": "4px", "type": "dimension" },
    "sm": { "value": "calc({spacing.base} * 2)", "type": "dimension" },
    "md": { "value": "calc({spacing.base} * 4)", "type": "dimension" },
    "lg": { "value": "calc({spacing.base} * 6)", "type": "dimension" }
  },
  "component": {
    "button": {
      "paddingX": { "value": "{spacing.md}", "type": "dimension" },
      "paddingY": { "value": "{spacing.sm}", "type": "dimension" },
      "background": { "value": "{color.interactive.default}", "type": "color" },
      "borderRadius": { "value": "4px", "type": "dimension" }
    }
  }
}
```